{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24395","headline":"分司洛中多暇数与诸客宴游醉後狂吟偶成十韵因招梦得宾客兼呈思黯奇章公 · 白居易","name":"分司洛中多暇数与诸客宴游醉後狂吟偶成十韵因招梦得宾客兼呈思黯奇章公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"性与时相远，身将世两忘。\n寄名朝士籍，寓兴少年场。\n老岂无谈笑，贫犹有酒浆。\n随时来伴侣，逐日用风光。\n数数游何爽，些些病未妨。\n天教荣啓乐，人恕接舆狂。\n改业爲逋客，移家住醉乡。\n不论招梦得，兼拟诱奇章。\n要路风波险，权门市井忙。\n世间无可恋，不是不思量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}